      "zh": "同一服务器、WCA 第 1–100 题、4 线程，每版一轮、不预热。Opt8 复用 11 月 9 日已有成绩；egg 适配版和两种原版编译共 300 个解均独立验证。CLI 计整批逐题求解时间，适配版计请求往返，均不含加载和 HTTP。AVX-512 比 AVX2 原版少用约 6.5% 时间，仍未快于 Opt8，该轮未通过上线门槛。各次测量时间不同，单轮结果不代表普遍性能。",
      "en": "Same server, WCA cases 1–100 and 4 threads; one pass per version, no warmup. Opt8 reuses its Nov 9 result. All 300 new egg solutions across the adapter and two CLI builds were independently verified. CLI uses sequential whole-batch wall time; adapters use request/reply wall time. Loading and HTTP are excluded. AVX-512 reduced original CLI time by about 6.5% but remained slower than Opt8, so that run did not qualify for promotion. Measurements were taken at different times; single-pass results are not universal."
